# Cursor-First Workflow

- Default development path is `/poteto-mode` (pstack) plus cursor-team-kit skills (deslop, review-and-ship, loop-on-ci). Retired pack commands `/fix`, `/feature`, `/epic`, `/new-project` are gone (D-063).
- Default to Cursor IDE agent or cloud agent chat for feature inception and implementation.
- Keep CI baseline checks in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` separate from agent automation workflows.
- For automation changes, prefer additive rollout: summarize findings first, then enable write/remediation.
- For visual work, follow `docs/ui.md` and tokens in `packages/ui`.
- When a product or AI-shape choice is unclear, do not pick silently. Fan out two or three options (`arena`, `how` critics, or `interrogate`) and have judges score them against `docs/product.md`: help the person, schema-held data, no training or chat-memory store, BYOK, draft not clinician, settings over one true path.
